ind":"announcement","title":"Demo version 1.7.5","summary":"Hello everyone!Steam Next Fest is just around the corner, so we are improving the Momotaro and the Oni Island Demo as much as we can!This demo patch includes some new animations, visual cues and some bug & input fixes.PLAY THE DEMO: https://store.steampowered.com/app/5024200/Momotaro_and_the_Oni_Island_Demo/Hope you give it a try, see you at Next Fest!👋","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:12:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941278","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4939960-1844115010496506","game_id":"steam-4939960","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Version 1.7 — Achievements Are Here!","summary":"📢 Demo Version 1.7 is now available! LINK TO DEMOThis update brings several improvements to Momotaro and the Oni Island, with Achievements as the main feature on this version!New AchievementsA new set of Steam Achievements has been added to the game. Can you unlock them all? Saves & Steam CloudYour progress is now saved, with Steam Cloud support allowing your saves to follow you across devices.Visual ImprovementsWe've made various visual improvements throughout the game to make your journey acro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T02:47:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496506","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4939960-1842846814447965","game_id":"steam-4939960","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v1.6.0: Leaderboards, Map Rework & Bug Fixes!","summary":"Hi everyone!Thank you so much to everyone who has been playing the demo and sharing their thoughts! Based on your valuable feedback, we’ve just deployed Patch v1.6.0 with a exciting new feature, balance adjustments, and fixes.Here is what’s new in this update:Global Leaderboards Are Live!The biggest addition to this patch is the integration of Steam Leaderboards!Test your skills against other players worldwide.Optimize your strategy, chase high scores, and claim your spot at the top of the ranki","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T22:16:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447965","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4939960-1842212951311835","game_id":"steam-4939960","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Demo of Momotaro and the Oni Island Right Now!","summary":"The adventure begins today!We are super excited to announce that the playable demo for Momotaro and the Oni Island is officially live and available to download right now directly from our Steam Store page!What’s inside the Demo?Match-3 Combat: Experience our core battle mechanics where strategy meets puzzle-solving.First Map Gameplay: Choose your path, fight unique enemies, and try the companion abilities.We Want Your Feedback!As an indie developer, your feedback during this stage is invaluable.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T00:41:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311835","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4939960-1840310314348406","game_id":"steam-4939960","kind":"announcement","title":"Momotaro and the Oni Island - Now on Steam! Add to your Wishlist","summary":"Welcome everyone! We are excited to announce that the official Steam page for Momotaro and the Oni Island is finally live!But, what is Momotaro and the Oni Island?Momotaro and the Oni Island is a match 3 adventure rpg game with combat elements where you can:Create color matches to launch elemental attacks against enemies,Match utility pieces to gather resources and survive longer,Use special skills, with game-changing effects.We’ve been working hard on refining the visual style, animations, and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T23:33:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348406","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4939960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:52Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4939960":"2026-10-26T05:31:52Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4939960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5024200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:31:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4939960","app_id":4939960,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ce9eea37fbd3b221145fe280e2c86fadd72494d558c7d7dbcdb5ac49d5f8204c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A bubble shooter roguelite based on the Japanese folktale. Throw orbs into the board to chain matches, play fire, water and plant against each other, and pick your path across Oni Island with companions who will fight at your side!","publishers":[{"name":"Nigiri Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Nigiri Games"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release